        title: "Best Honeymoon Destinations for October 2026/27",
        dek: "October is one of those sweet spots in the travel calendar. The summer crowds have thinned, the weather is still kind in many parts of the world, and destinations begin to slow down—making it easier to soak in each moment. It’s the kind of setting that suits a honeymoon perfectly",
        heroImage: "/blog-images/top-honeymoon-destinations-for-october-discover-peru-bora-bora-and-spain/conrad-bora-bora-nui.png",
