  <h3>Relaxation at <a href="https://www.virtuoso.com/advisor/wilsschu27955/hotels/6164329/montage-palmetto-bluff?search=%22Montage%20Palmetto%20Bluff%22&amp;mode=Gts#amenitiesTab" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Montage Palmetto Bluff, South Carolina</a> (Top Babymoon Destination for June 2026)</h3>

                <figure><img src="/blog-images/top-babymoon-destinations-for-every-month-of-the-year/palmetto-suite.png" alt="Palmetto Suite" loading="lazy"></figure>

