  <h3>Sun and Serenity at <a href="https://www.virtuoso.com/advisor/wilsschu27955/hotels/11245972/sugar-beach-a-viceroy-resort#amenitiesTab" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sugar Beach, A Viceroy Resort, St. Lucia</a> (Top Babymoon Destination for November 2026)</h3>

