        title: "The Ultimate Italian Escape: Luxury 7-Day Itinerary Through Northern Italy &amp; Tuscany's Most Exclusive Stays",
        dek: "Here’s an overview of your 7-day luxurious journey through Northern Italy, designed to offer a seamless blend of relaxation, cultural immersion, and unforgettable experiences.",
        heroImage: "/blog-images/luxury-7-day-itinerary-through-northern-italy-and-tuscanys-most-exclusive-stays/the-hotel-s-facade.png",
